e has ever received. Later he runs into her on the street worried that she might attack some random male while walking around he escorts her home. On the way they run into his eldest sister Kazue. Mahiru get flustered and admits to \"assaulting\" Takanashi on a regular basis.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/egVaF2Mclc1rZUfQhUeoWb431AS.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6780","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6956","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6956","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"19829","synopsis":"Otoo returns to Wagnaria once again this time bringing with him a new waitress, Yamada Aoi. Aoi tells a \"tragic tale of woe\" to which Takanashi responds that she is a liar. Reluctantly he ends up training Aoi in how to be a waitress. As the day progress she tries to assign the various staff members into a fake family structure.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zzPo2Qbdeubz24JeAOh1ZfGEQC5.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Otoo returns to Wagnaria once again this time bringing with him a new waitress, Yamada Aoi. Aoi tells a \"tragic tale of woe\" to which Takanashi responds that she is a liar. Reluctantly he ends up training Aoi in how to be a waitress. As the day progress she tries to assign the various staff members into a fake family structure.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zzPo2Qbdeubz24JeAOh1ZfGEQC5.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6780","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"pro